{"channelId":"UCTL69SgzlKyU7wJDEW_75zg","row":["Cats Of San Bernardino",525761,"Cats of San Bernardino was started by Jaina and Ivy Spagis when they moved to San Bernardino in 2016\nfrom Los Angeles. They were shocked that San Bernardino did not offer free spay and neuter\nservices like LA and realized that the feral situation in their new neighborhood was out of\ncontrol. They began trapping and spaying/neutering feral cats at their own expense, but soon\nrealized the problem was too big to tackle on their own.\n\nThey have converted their home into an animal sanctuary, providing space for kittens and their\nmommas waiting for adoption, rehabilitation areas for recovering injured cats, play areas for\nhealthy cats. With the help of foster families in the city of San\nBernardino they have as many as 50 cats in their care at one time.Their dream is to one day\nhave a large property/facility which will help save thousands of more lives. This new property\nwould have catios, feral enclosures, a medical room, nursery, rehabilitation area, and adoption\ncenter.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTL69SgzlKyU7wJDEW_75zg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTL69SgzlKyU7wJDEW_75zg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:02.374Z","channelId":"UCTL69SgzlKyU7wJDEW_75zg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"eeb16f2efd3c0f3e13484260d80f4f788472417062287976ef902cc8241ace11","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e52eea0481e59a51c03d6d87b1956c6d5857d2b34a5e4387d3f07a76ad714da6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTL69SgzlKyU7wJDEW_75zg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:17:28.394Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/catsofsanbernardino","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":525761,"raw":"525761","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/catsofsanbernardino/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:29:43.130Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url"